From 106adad45a9c049b29c061e2ba8f8024304efbfb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: 1785235376-blip <1785235376@qq.com>
Date: Sat, 29 Aug 2026 10:20:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] feat: add windows appcontainer sandbox prototype

Host-owned Test Worker can be launched via spawn_sandboxed_host_test_worker()
inside a real Windows AppContainer (ctypes, CapabilityCount=0, unique
per-run profile, staged runtime copy, staging-only ACL). Job Object is
resource containment only. Non-Windows and any launch failure raise
fail-closed SandboxError and never fall back to spawn_host_test_worker().

This is not third-party plugin execution. execution_supported stays false.
Real Windows TokenIsAppContainer proof remains REQUIRED / NOT RUN.
